The '''Remote Island''' is a small [[:Category:Locations|island]].

==Location==
The Remote Island can be found near the [[Kingdom of Rose]], toward [[Jeremy]]. The player can also come here by using [[Portal]]'s {{Ability|Portal|C}}.

==Inhabitants==
{| class="article-table"
!NPCs
|-
|
* [[Legendary Sword Dealer]] (only for 15 minutes if it did spawn in the island)
* [[The Strongest God]]
* [[Xindra tentashun]]
|}

==Notes==
* This island is close to other islands but [[Sea Beast]]<nowiki/>s can still spawn on it.
* This island is used mainly to wait for a [[Sea Beast]] to spawn, but also used for the given reasons - 
* The [[Legendary Sword Dealer]] can spawn in the center house of the Remote Island.
* The [[Flowers|{{Flower|Blue}} flower]] has two spawn locations on the Remote Island.
* [[Blox_Fruits|Fruits]] can spawn on the Remote Island.
* [[Chests]] are located inside the first house and behind the third house of the Remote Island.

==Trivia==
* The Remote Island has no display name upon going onto it. However, its location name displayed on the [[Portal]] {{Ability|Portal|C}}'s GUI is "Remote", making it its sole "official" name.
* Since the Remote Island is not really considered an island, driving a [[Miracle]] onto this island will not make the boat land onto the sea. Therefore, the player can land the boat onto the ground of this island itself, just like [[skylands]], [[Jean-Luc Island]] and [[Cave Island]]. This makes the island really good for hunting sea beasts, as other players of different races other than [[Shark]] can freely stand on the island and fight Sea enemies while standing on the island without the problem of them falling into water.

